{"t":"NSC","n":"Norfolk Southern Corporation","nKo":"노퍽 서던","ex":"NYSE","cur":"USD","px":316.65,"chg":5.64,"chgPct":0.01813,"prev":311.01,"dayH":318.02,"dayL":312.44,"w52H":358.6,"w52L":277.8,"vol":982897,"avgVol":1287980,"mcap":71124869120,"pe":26.54,"fpe":21.75,"eps":11.93,"feps":14.56,"pb":4.25,"div":5.4,"divY":0.0171,"beta":1.18,"short":5903083,"shortPct":0.0263,"shortRatio":7.29,"prof":{"c":"United States","cKo":"미국","s":"Industrials","sKo":"산업재","i":"Railroads","iKo":"철도","city":"Atlanta","emp":19300,"web":"https://www.norfolksouthern.com","sum":"Norfolk Southern Corporation, together with its subsidiaries, engages in the rail transportation of raw materials, intermediate products, and finished goods in the United States. The company transports agriculture, forest, and consumer products comprising soybeans, wheat, corn, fertilizers, livestock and poultry feed, food products, food oils, flour, sweeteners, ethanol, lumber and wood products, pulp board and paper products, wood fibers, wood pulp, beverages, and canned goods; chemicals, including sulfur and related chemicals, petroleum products comprising crude oil, chlorine and bleaching compounds, plastics, rubber, industrial chemicals, chemical wastes, sand, and natural gas liquids; metals and construction materials, such as steel, aluminum products, machinery, scrap metals, cement, ","sumKo":"Norfolk Southern Corporation은 자회사와 함께 미국에서 원자재, 중간 제품 및 완제품의 철도 운송에 종사하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 대두, 밀, 옥수수, 비료, 가축 및 가금류 사료, 식품, 식용유, 밀가루, 감미료, 에탄올, 목재 및 목재 제품, 펄프 보드 및 종이 제품, 목재 섬유, 목재 펄프, 음료 및 통조림 제품으로 구성된 농업, 임업 및 소비재를 운송합니다. 유황 및 관련 화학 물질, 원유, 염소 및 표백 화합물로 구성된 석유 제품, 플라스틱, 고무, 산업용 화학 물질, 화학 폐기물, 모래 및 천연 가스 액체를 포함한 화학 물질; 철강, 알루미늄 제품, 기계, 고철, 시멘트와 같은 금속 및 건축 자재,"},"fin":{"annual":[{"y":2022,"rev":12745000000,"ni":3270000000},{"y":2023,"rev":12156000000,"ni":1827000000},{"y":2024,"rev":12123000000,"ni":2622000000},{"y":2025,"rev":12180000000,"ni":2873000000}],"quarterly":[{"q":"4Q2025","rev":2974000000,"ni":644000000},{"q":"1Q2026"